						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														This will be the first Raid after the split.  This is just to see who all is still here.  I pulled up the map off EQmaps.com and there are some serious loot AND a bonus to xp here.  Whooo and Hooo.  Hope to see you there<br />
