					<div class="xsmall">3/12/2001 - 11:36 PM PST</div>
					<hr width="75%" align="left">
					<div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=673">Thadius Amerot</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=674">Bellaargh</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=675">Archangelle</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=676">Banshi</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=678">Mystyque</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=677">Kurtwagnerr</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=679">Forrge</a></div>					
					<br>
				</td>
				<td width="70%" class="body" valign="top">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														Alrighty then!  Dalnir Raid was a bust.  No one got anything of value and plenty of player deaths to go around.  Plus most of us took about 3 hours to even get to the raid sight.  So Coramor and I have decided to really plan this one out.  <br />
<br />
1.)  Sign-up if you are gonna be there.  Go to the events page and add your name to the rouster.<br />
<br />
2.)  Get a map.  I suggest EQmaps.  EqAtlas has some as well.  It really helps when you know where your heading and which way is quickest zone.<br />
<br />
3.)  Post post post.  Let us know where you'd like to have the next RaidNight.  What direction you feel the guild needs to go in.<br />
<br />
4.)  Show up.  This is all about getting to know each other inside the guild.  We need to unify into a cohesive unit if we are to ever do plane runs or dragon runs.  <br />
<br />
5.)  Pass the word.  Talk it up.  Guildsay has gave us an awesome tool.  Lets make sure everyone knows about it.  Lets also make sure everyone knows our next target.  This isn't rocket science:  Every Monday 5pm PST.<br />
<br />
<br />
Thanks for those of you who have the desire and the vision of a unified Guild.  Huzzah!!<br />
<br />
Thadius						</td>
